.TH PATH_BASENAME 3
.SH NAME
path_basename \- extract the basename from a path
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "path.h"
.PP
.B char* path_basename(const char* path);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B path_basename
returns a pointer to the final component of the file path 
.I path.
It identifies the basename by searching for the last directory separator in the string.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a pointer to the start of the basename within the original 
.I path 
string.